    "Panop draws subtitles itself with the Lume player. The system player follows this once you change it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Panop zeichnet Untertitel beim Lume-Player selbst. Der System-Player folgt dem, sobald du etwas änderst."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Panop found these saved in your iCloud: %@. Use them here?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Panop hat diese in deinem iCloud gefunden: %@. Hier verwenden?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Panop goes back to the engine order for every title, and learns again as you watch." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Panop nutzt für jeden Titel wieder die Engine-Reihenfolge und merkt sich beim Schauen neu, was funktioniert."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Panop is free software under the GNU General Public Licence, version 3. The parts it is built from are listed in THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Panop ist freie Software unter der GNU General Public License, Version 3. Die Teile, aus denen es besteht, stehen in THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Panop is free software under the MIT licence. The parts it is built from are listed in THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
